// Min-Mozhi example (Tamil flavor — same grammar, only the keywords change): combinational cover — a functional-coverage hit counter checked every settled state.
// Stripped from synthesis (`ifndef SYNTHESIS` in the emitted Verilog); active in simulation.

தொகுதி Divider {
  உள்ளீடு a: bits[8]
  உள்ளீடு b: bits[8]
  வெளியீடு q: bits[8]

  அளவிடு(b == 0, "divisor was zero")
  q = a
}
